      "text": "The scoring algorithm is asymmetric around the true time of failure, with late predictions penalized more heavily than early predictions, and is defined by a piecewise exponential function (eq. 11) using parameters a1 = 10 and a2 = 13.",
      "citations": [1, 6]
    }
  ],
  "gaps": "",
